      "message": "feat(rsi): wire RSI runtime into live release line (selective integration)\n\nSelective reconstruction step 2: port the RSI integration hunks onto the\nrelease-line versions of four shared files. main.mjs gains the RsiRuntimeService\nstartup step, state projection, outcome attribution helper, and the\nonRsiOutcomeReadback ingest hook. native-supervisor-client-base.mjs gains the\nimmutable result-delivery adapter path with batch ambiguity reconciliation,\nthe outcome readback sidecar, and the transport-ambiguity fence that never\nmanufactures a second FAILED receipt. The supervisor edge gains the\n/v1/commands/:id/receipt readback route with capability projection, and the\ngovernance preview gains per-ref concurrency cancellation.\n\nAll other pre-existing files remain byte-identical to the live release line\n(release/self-update-ambiguity-live-v2 at 322be784). Full Browser Node suite:\n3216 pass / 0 fail / 2 platform skips.",
